# Bookings
GET    /admin/bookings                     → BookingController@index
PATCH  /admin/bookings/{booking}/status    → BookingController@updateStatus
PUT    /admin/bookings/{booking}/notes     → BookingController@updateNotes
DELETE /admin/bookings/{booking}           → BookingController@destroy
```

