### Controllers

#### [NEW] `Admin\PackageController`

| Method | Logic |
|--------|-------|
| `index()` | Return `admin.packages.index` view with all packages (ordered), grouped by currency for clarity |
| `store(StorePackageRequest)` | Create package, return JSON `{ success, package }` |
| `update(UpdatePackageRequest, Package)` | Update package, return JSON |
| `destroy(Package)` | Delete package (bookings keep null FK), return JSON |
| `toggleActive(Package)` | Toggle `is_active`, return JSON `{ success, is_active }` |

#### [NEW] `Admin\BookingController`

| Method | Logic |
|--------|-------|
| `index()` | Return `admin.bookings.index` with all bookings (latest first), eager-load package. Optional `?status=` filter query param |
| `updateStatus(Booking)` | Validate new status from `Booking::STATUSES`, update, return JSON |
| `updateNotes(Booking)` | Update admin notes, return JSON |
| `destroy(Booking)` | Delete booking, return JSON |

#### [NEW] `BookSessionController` (public)

| Method | Logic |
|--------|-------|
| `store(StoreBookingRequest)` | Prefix `+` to country_code if missing, create Booking with status `'new'`, return JSON `{ success, message }`. Rate-limited: 3/min per IP. |

